<title>BRAZIL: Brazil stocks pare losses to end off 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Brazil stocks pare losses to end off 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil shares pared losses to close down 0.4 percent on investor misunderstanding of a court ruling on state telecom Telebras shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Bovespa index of the 42 most traded shares fell 270 points to close at 66,486 points. Turnover was heavy at 530 million reais ($516.6 million).</p>
</text>
